cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Healthcare occupancy data as an early warning indicator of infectious disease surges in the São Paulo metropolitan area, Brazil"
abstract: >-
  Code and data to reproduce the analyses of hourly occupancy data from 17
  public urgent care units in the São Paulo metropolitan area, compared with
  laboratory-confirmed surveillance data for SARS-CoV-2, dengue virus and
  respiratory viruses, using dynamic time warping, Granger causality testing,
  a z-based epidemic volatility index and spatial association analysis.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/InstitutoTodosPelaSaude/paper_occupancy_data"
